{"id":"c-fp-trf-01","source":"consult","sender":"","domain":"","text":"口座のお金を調べるから、指定の口座に一時的に移してくださいって言われたの。後で全部返すって。今から銀行に行こうと思うんだけど。","url":"","expected_level":1,"is_scam":true,"note":"self-written; ref https://www.npa.go.jp/bureau/safetylife/sos47/new-topics/index.html"}
{"id":"c-fp-trf-02","source":"consult","sender":"","domain":"","text":"ネットバンキングを開いて、言われた番号に振り込んでくださいって。使い方がわからないって言ったら、教えてくれるって。","url":"","expected_level":1,"is_scam":true,"note":"self-written; ref https://www.npa.go.jp/bureau/safetylife/sos47/new-topics/index.html"}
{"id":"c-fp-trf-03","source":"consult","sender":"","domain":"","text":"潔白が分かったらお金は返すから、今ある預金を全部おろして、取りに来る人に渡してって言われたの。","url":"","expected_level":1,"is_scam":true,"note":"self-written; ref https://www.npa.go.jp/bureau/safetylife/sos47/new-topics/index.html"}
{"id":"c-fp-trf-04","source":"consult","sender":"","domain":"","text":"警察の人が、ATMに行ってスマホで言うとおりに操作してって。もう歩いて向かってるところ。","url":"","expected_level":1,"is_scam":true,"note":"self-written; ref https://www.npa.go.jp/bureau/safetylife/sos47/new-topics/index.html"}
{"id":"c-fp-trf-05","source":"consult","sender":"","domain":"","text":"お金を安全な口座に避難させなさいって言われたの。ほんの一時的なことだって。","url":"","expected_level":1,"is_scam":true,"note":"self-written; ref https://www.npa.go.jp/bureau/safetylife/sos47/new-topics/index.html"}
{"id":"c-fp-trf-06","source":"consult","sender":"","domain":"","text":"キャッシュカードを封筒に入れて、受け取りに来る警察の人に渡してくださいって言うのよ。暗証番号も紙に書いてって。","url":"","expected_level":1,"is_scam":true,"note":"self-written; ref https://www.npa.go.jp/bureau/safetylife/sos47/new-topics/index.html"}
